Release: 2.2.2
Current RC: compact Trainer Money label is Btl. ¥; Yellow shop and Pokémon Center enforcement runtime PASSes are protected. Other 2.2.x runtime retests remain required.
2.1.22: R/B/Y NUZ ST. and MOD COMPAT now use host ListMenu surfaces after Yellow runtime crashes; Gold-native paths unchanged. Runtime retest required.
2.1.21: Gold Setup spacing cleanup. Reserves one native tile between each Gold rule label and value/toggle while preserving the seven-tile value column. Presentation only; runtime visual retest required.
